## 8.3 Containerization and Orchestration

| Komponen                 | Pengelolaan                                                            | Referensi        |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Layanan Go & Web SPA     | *Image* Docker, dijalankan sebagai **Deployment** *stateless*.        | ADR-006, NFR-013 |
| Apache Kafka             | *Operator* **Strimzi** (StatefulSet, PV, RF≥3).                       | ADR-004          |
| PostgreSQL               | *Operator* **CloudNativePG/Zalando** (primary–standby, PITR).         | ADR-004          |
| Kong                     | Deployment HA (control/data plane), multi-replica.                    | ADR-003          |
| Apicurio Registry        | Deployment HA + penyimpanan skema persisten.                          | ADR-003          |
| Platform services        | Observability, secret manager, cert-manager, CI/CD agent.             | ADR-010          |

Seluruh komponen dijalankan **self-managed** (bukan *managed service*) untuk kendali & kedaulatan data (ADR-004).

