## 8.6 Scalability and Resource Management

| Mekanisme                | Penerapan                                                              | Referensi        |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Horizontal Pod Autoscaler| Skala layanan Go *stateless* berdasarkan CPU/RPS/lag.                  | NFR-010, ARC-002 |
| Requests/Limits          | Alokasi CPU/memori per *pod* untuk prediktabilitas.                    | NFR-012          |
| Resource Quota per tenant| Kuota namespace/tenant mencegah *noisy neighbor*.                       | NFR-012, ARC-004 |
| Kafka scaling            | Penambahan *partition* & *consumer group* tanpa perubahan kode.        | NFR-011          |
| PostgreSQL scaling       | *Read replica* + partisi untuk beban baca/historis.                    | NFR-011          |

