## 8.7 High Availability and Failover

| Kapabilitas              | Realisasi                                                              | Target NFR       |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Multi-replica services   | Minimum 2 replika per layanan kritikal; *anti-affinity* antar-node.   | NFR-005          |
| Multi-AZ (bila tersedia) | Distribusi node/broker lintas *availability zone*.                    | NFR-005          |
| Pod Disruption Budget    | Menjaga jumlah replika minimum saat *maintenance*.                     | NFR-006          |
| Database failover        | *Automatic failover* primary→standby < 60 detik.                      | NFR-004, NFR-005 |
| Kafka resilience         | RF≥3, `min.insync.replicas=2`.                                        | NFR-009          |
| Self-healing             | Restart otomatis Kubernetes pada kegagalan *pod*.                     | NFR-004          |

Tidak ada *single point of failure* pada komponen kritikal (NFR-005, ARC-003).

---

## 8.8 Disaster Recovery Topology

| Elemen                   | Realisasi                                                              | Target NFR       |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| DR site                  | Region/lokasi terpisah secara geografis (geo-redundant).              | NFR-028, NFR-030 |
| Replikasi data           | PostgreSQL streaming/async replication + *WAL archiving* ke DR.        | NFR-028          |
| Replikasi event          | **Kafka MirrorMaker** antar-region.                                   | NFR-030          |
| Failover DR              | Aktivasi *DR site* semi-otomatis; RTO ≤ 4 jam.                        | NFR-028          |
| DR drill                 | Uji *failover* menyeluruh minimum 1×/tahun.                            | NFR-030          |

RPO ≤ 15 menit (NFR-028) dijaga melalui frekuensi replikasi/backup (BAB 6.9).

